{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner monkey in a chaotic, rhythm-driven arcade shooter. Boogie, fight and laugh your way through insane parties where <strong>holding the dance pad is the key to victory</strong>. Play with up to 12 players, and even customize the soundtrack with<strong> Steam</strong> <strong>Workshop music packs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the beat is your goal. Stand on the pad, match the rhythm, and rack up points - but staying alive is half the battle. <strong>The dance pad has new power-ups every round</strong>, letting you launch missiles, bend time, or laser down rivals in unpredictable musical mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join into a <strong>private lobby</strong> with friends or venture into <strong>public parties</strong> for worldwide fun! <strong>Voice chat </strong>keeps the energy loud and chaotic as you fight, fling bananas, and battle for the beat. <strong>Modes include:</strong> Free-For-All, Teams, Infected, Payload, Banana Grab, Ape Arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/22546f686494e9fc11848f515a17f1ba.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/22546f686494e9fc11848f515a17f1ba.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across wild, thematic arenas\u2014pirate coves, desert mesas, radiated towns, space stations clubs, and more. <strong>Every stage adds its own surprises, hazards, and unique strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow Us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay updated with the latest news and exclusive content by following us on our social medias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t want to miss out on this party!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3217900?t=1771462092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/d7e5bb8c35fda92bd64387c348076713bd28a9eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771462092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/89562513d8fcb8b9da4e1a0f2c1611b27b9de0ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771462092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/89562513d8fcb8b9da4e1a0f2c1611b27b9de0ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771462092","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3547710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/0443addd2e12399c93e50c47b6ab01c0.avif?t=1771462092\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/f2c72b86c33739d20f33fbbc93d7a9c8.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner monkey in a chaotic, rhythm-driven arcade shooter. Boogie, fight and laugh your way through insane parties where <strong>holding the dance pad is the key to victory</strong>. Play with up to 12 players, and even customize the soundtrack with<strong> Steam</strong> <strong>Workshop music packs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/00204e6e7b6fbf39e6913746b2b3d07c.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the beat is your goal. Stand on the pad, match the rhythm, and rack up points - but staying alive is half the battle. <strong>The dance pad has new power-ups every round</strong>, letting you launch missiles, bend time, or laser down rivals in unpredictable musical mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/4c72defb9d4cdc4ae7831b62ff558600.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join into a <strong>private lobby</strong> with friends or venture into <strong>public parties</strong> for worldwide fun! <strong>Voice chat </strong>keeps the energy loud and chaotic as you fight, fling bananas, and battle for the beat. <strong>Modes include:</strong> Free-For-All, Teams, Infected, Payload, Banana Grab, Ape Arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/22546f686494e9fc11848f515a17f1ba.poster.avif?t=1771462092\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/22546f686494e9fc11848f515a17f1ba.webm?t=1771462092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across wild, thematic arenas\u2014pirate coves, desert mesas, radiated towns, space stations clubs, and more. <strong>Every stage adds its own surprises, hazards, and unique strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow Us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay updated with the latest news and exclusive content by following us on our social medias.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t want to miss out on this party!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Sloth King"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/4aef9526d8f110c9c1ab9ccde52dbf227dd0ebd0/header.jpg?t=1771462092","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3217900/1560002407/9269bb5db7de3a7f1da5f7e3f9916f3d8ee22a97/1764747258/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766074805","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3217900/1560002407/9269bb5db7de3a7f1da5f7e3f9916f3d8ee22a97/1764747258/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766074805","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3217900/1560002407/9269bb5db7de3a7f1da5f7e3f9916f3d8ee22a97/1764747258/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766074805","id":257087184,"